					<div id="pos_content" class="cms_position">
						<div id="mod_25" class="cms_module">
							<p>
								<span>The shapefile was generated from NAD83 geographic
									positions of boundary monuments and turning points. Some
									coordinates are from recent surveys, while most are datum
									conversion. It is </span><span>for mapping use only and must
									not be used to define the boundary. Metadata files are included
									and are country specific.&#65279;.</span>&#65279;
							</p>
							<hr />
							<p>&nbsp;</p>
							<ul>
								<li><a title="Boundary shapefile"
									href="/uploads/shapefile/us-canada-boundary-v1-3.zip" target="_blank">Download
										shapefile version 1.3</a></li>
							</ul>

						</div>
					</div>

				</div>
